in your words, I shall end your life.

6
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:04,280
I love you.

7
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,277
Thank

8
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,677
you

9
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:44,760
so

10
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:01,039
much for watching.

11
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,360
What are you doing?

12
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:09,020
I knew I'd find you boys goofing off.

13
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,140
Tonkii it.

14
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,780
Oh, hi, Alice.

15
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:17,797
Did your sacred arts
class let out early today?

16
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:18,817
Because, like...

17
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:21,429
You're Integrity Knight
Alice Synthesis 30.

18
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,897
I'm not early at all.

19
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:25,600
But your real name is Alice Zuberg.

20
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:28,580
Your dad's the elder of ruling.

21
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,641
Have some lunch.

22
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:33,832
I heard you were good at sacred
arts and cooking as a kid.

23
00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:38,717
Alice, your cooking keeps getting better.

24
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,630
For real.

25
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,680
Oh, I don't know.

26
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,780
It turned out okay, I guess.

27
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,765
But it could have been better.

28
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,120
Eight years ago,

29
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,937
you and this boy who was
your best friend went to

30
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:56,020
the End Mountains to get
some ice for your village.

31
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,840
On the way out, you took the wrong tunnel.

32
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,050
longer.

33
00:03:03,133 --> 00:03:03,963
There it is!

34
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,520
Where are we?

35
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:24,200
The Dark Territory.

36
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:30,340
You came out where the taboo
index forbids everyone from going.

37
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:32,520
The dark territory.

38
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,140
No, wait!

39
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,540
Alice!

40
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:26,157
All you did was touch the ground in the
dark territory with your fingertips,

41
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:31,560
but no one can violate the Taboo
Index, not even by mistake.

42
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:35,777
Your daughter Alice Zuburg
has disobeyed the Taboo Index.

43
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:41,080
I shall take her with me to answer
for her crimes and be executed.

44
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:52,800
Don't just stand there! Go help her!

45
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:13,370
Ugeo!

46
00:05:13,453 --> 00:05:15,060
Get these guys off me!

47
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,340
Come on, hurry!

48
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:17,850
Ugeo!

49
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:35,160
You were taken, Senator.

50
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:38,380
