called Tiese Elbert.

51
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:41,528
No one knew what happened
to you after that.

52
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:53,521
Well, actually, someone used to bring me
my lunch every day, but that was years ago.

53
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:54,710
Oh, well.

54
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,640
So why'd they stop?

55
