She was my childhood friend.

56
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:06,640
And she was the same age as me.

57
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:10,400
When we were little, we
played together all the time.

58
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:16,180
And after I received my calling, she would
bring me lunch every day without fail.

59
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:21,857
But then, because of me...

60
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:23,797
That boy who was your best friend,

61
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:27,704
his name's Eugeo, and his calling
was to cut down the Giga Cedar.

62
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:31,272
It was his idea to find you
and bring you back to rule it.

63
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,860
I'm scared.

64
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:42,120
But I can't just stand here.

65
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:45,784
I can't make the same
mistake I made with Alice.

66
00:06:46,780 --> 00:06:48,839
When Tiese Elbrick came to take you,

67
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:51,754
