70
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:58,100
Get him down! No!

71
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:07,460
This time, I'll fight!

72
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,134
And protect my friend!

73
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:15,740
Run, Yu-Gi-Oh!

74
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,670
Yu-Gi-Oh!

75
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:34,680
Yu-Gi-Oh!

76
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,240
Yu-Gi-Oh!

77
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:45,880
Hang on, Yu-Gi-Oh! Please!

78
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:50,200
We made a promise.

79
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,260
You, me, and Alice.

80
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:56,340
We promised we'd protect each other.

81
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:01,377
I couldn't six years ago,

82
00:08:01,460 --> 00:08:06,820
but now, finally, I got to.

83
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:15,477
Eugeo figured if he was
going to bring you back home,

84
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:19,220
he'd have to get stronger, so
he decided to be a swordsman.

85
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,980
Hey, look it! And what?

86
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:05,541
After seven years of chopping away at the
Giga Cedar, Eugeo had finally cut it down.

87
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,294
That's how he got to pick
swordsmen for his new calling.

88
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,340
Well then, are you ready?

89
00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:13,770
Uh-huh.

90
00:09:13,853 --> 00:09:16,780
He left Rulid for Senator,
and I went with him.

91
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:24,237
It took a while, but we got
into the Swordcraft Academy.

92
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:28,200
We had good mentors there
and learned a ton from them.

93
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:33,452
The plan was to become Integrity Knights,

94
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:37,420
get inside the Central Cathedral,
find you, and bring you home.

95
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,277
First things first, though.

96
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,880
We have to ace this exam.

97
00:09:43,300 --> 00:09:45,418
Only the top 12 will get to advance.

98
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:48,182
After we became Elite Disciples,

99
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:51,596
