we weren't prepared for.

100
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:55,660
Yu-Gi-Oh's page, Tiese,
and my page, Ronie.

101
00:09:56,080 --> 00:10:01,920
They were taken prisoner by two bastards
from noble families, Umber and Rios.

102
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:07,520
Yu-Gi-Oh went to their room to
confront them and save the girls.

103
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:13,060
Such is my sovereign right!

104
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:20,077
Stop your squirming and take your punishment
like a good girl. Leave him alone!

105
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,920
Hold your ground, commoner!

106
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:27,760
Raios ordered Eugeo not to move,
and he was frozen on the spot.

107
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:32,380
He had to stand there and watch
as those two assaulted the girls.

108
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:37,597
And the only reason he was
powerless to help was because the

109
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:41,320
Taboo Index says commoners have
to obey a nobleman's orders.

110
00:10:42,940 --> 00:10:48,260
It's a stupid law that's planted in the
souls of every person in the human empire.

111
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:50,680
No one can defy it.

112
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:54,960
If upholding laws like
these is my duty, then...

113
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:57,760
Then I...

114
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,230
I...

115
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,017
What's going on?

116
00:11:16,100 --> 00:11:19,040
Wait, this happened before.

117
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,500
This is evil.

118
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:26,100
I have to...

119
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:29,940
Stop them!

120
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:33,320
Help us! Please!

121
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:34,730
Yadiyah!

122
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:45,800
Instead of standing there helpless,

123
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:49,240
and obeying the taboo index?

124
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:52,880
laws that kept him from
saving people he cared about.

125
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:55,960
He chose to do what's
right and fought back.

126
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:17,800
That piece of junk will shatter
against my secret technique.

127
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,315
We'll see about that.

128
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:42,760
Well, now, how is that?

129
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:45,500
You can't possibly have thought I,

130
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:49,900
