I was protecting Eugeo.

132
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:23,497
But the Taboo Index forbids
killing another human,

133
00:13:23,580 --> 00:13:25,639
or even taking part in their death.

134
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:28,940
So, Yu-Gi-Oh and I were arrested.

135
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:34,280
I am the Integrity Knight who
oversees the capital of Senator.

136
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,960
I am Alice Synthesis 30.

137
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,780
Alice, it's you, isn't it?

138
00:13:56,920 --> 00:14:02,280
