147
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,200
Enhance armament.

148
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,340
Don't sweat it.

149
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:38,340
A whip can only reach so far.

150
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,040
We're safe here.

151
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,680
