152
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:06,597
And fighting him, we got a taste of the
secret skills of you Integrity Knights.

153
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:09,540
Perfect weapon control and memory release.

154
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,640
No wonder Lady Alice was wary of you.

155
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:18,460
Your attacks have no pattern, which
is surprising and slightly irritating.

156
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:22,317
The only way we survived
Eldrie is because we

157
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:25,459
stumbled on another secret
of the Integrity Knights.

158
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:33,480
What's that?

159
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:40,760
I bet Alice got one of those, too, when
they blocked her memory and changed her.

160
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:45,957
But then, Tiese Elbert showed up, and
we had to get the hell out of there.

161
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:51,257
Tempting an Integrity Knight to fall
from grace is unforgivable, you wretches.

162
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:55,360
I shall pin you down, then
return you to your cell!

163
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:57,620
This way!

164
00:16:01,180 --> 00:16:02,580
Dead end up ahead!

165
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:03,800
What do we do?

166
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:05,570
Hey!

167
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,260
Over here!

168
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:08,840
Follow her!

169
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,380
Where are we?

170
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,551
Now they know we're here.

171
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,938
We can't use this back door anymore.

172
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,620
We'd be dead if it wasn't for Cardinal.

173
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:33,492
She's the caretaker of the Great Library.

174
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:37,537
She's the one who told me all
the secrets of this world.

175
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:38,450
Thank you.

176
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:40,480
Come with me.

177
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:46,060
I'll try to be as succinct as possible.

178
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,077
System call.

179
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,880
Generate luminous element.

180
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:52,700
Form Element.

181
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,120
Liquid Shape.

182
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:05,197
She told about how a simple girl
named Quinella became Administrator,

183
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:07,720
the Pontifex of the Axiom Church.

184
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,520
Through the Synthesis Ritual,

185
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:16,897
this man will be reborn as a
warrior devoted only to me,

186
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:18,940
my Integrity Knight.

187
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:22,837
She also told me how
you knights are made by

188
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:25,802
sealing away your memories
and planting fake ones

189
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:27,980
And how do I do that?

190
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:32,713
Simply remove the piety module All the
knights have one in their forehead.

191
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:36,377
It looks like a triangle When Yu-Gi-Oh
had a chance to ask her something,

192
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:38,680
he asked how to get your memory back?

193
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:41,800
And then to get to you,

194
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:45,628
we had to fight our way through
a bunch of Integrity Knights!

195
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:48,360
No bear! I can't...

196
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:59,320
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

197
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,680
I'm gonna teach you a lesson today.

198
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:04,457
You're gonna watch these
knights you made fun

199
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:07,364
of fight and see what
real strength's all about.

200
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:19,137
You didn't come this far because you
hated the integrity knights did you?

201
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:21,857
You're here to get Alice back.

202
00:18:21,940 --> 00:18:24,357
You're here because you love her.

203
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:25,537
But guess what?

204
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:31,777
That integrity knight she feels just as
strong about her duty and I'm no different.

205
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:34,337
I want to protect everyone in this world.

206
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:35,820
You?

207
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:43,280
You, Alice, even this night, we're so
close, and we can't afford to give up now.

208
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,740
Ain't that right, Yu-Gi-Oh?

209
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:58,200
We made it all the way up to the 80th
floor, and that's where we found you.

210
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,720
I shall eliminate you.

211
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:06,519
Enhance armaments!

212
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:16,040
He went for my sword!

213
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:20,714
We thought we had a good plan, but
you were stronger than the both of us.

214
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:25,960
Now here we are, on the
wall outside the cathedral.

215
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:31,550
No!

216
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,635
Come and get it, kid.

217
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,808
I bet Eugeo's fighting
his way up right now.

218
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,060
Looking for you.

219
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:55,880
Blue Rose Sword, lend me your power.

220
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:58,400
Release Recollection!

221
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,310
That's it.

222
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:09,286
But there's one last
thing I have to tell you.

223
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:14,052
Soon, everything in this world
is going to come to an end.

224
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,118
Cardinal told me it's about
to enter its final phase,

225
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:20,968
and there's no stopping it.

226
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:24,940
The day when the Dark Territory
invades the human empire.

227
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:29,157
Cardinal's job is to make sure
there's balance in this world,

228
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:32,060
and she told me she
didn't accept its fate.

229
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,957
She believes the only way to
restore balance to the underworld

230
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:43,520
now is to wipe the slate clean
and return it to nothing.

231
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:54,100
So this is it.

232
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:59,100
Now I see this is what
it means to be human.

233
00:21:05,460 --> 00:21:06,617
To be held.

234
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:09,397
It's so warm and comforting.

235
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:11,637
After 200 years.

236
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:14,037
This makes the wait worth it.

237
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,297
To think something so simple!

238
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:18,120
Could be so satisfying.

239
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:21,580
The wait was more than worth it.

240
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:25,657
She's not looking forward
to what she has to do.

241
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:26,977
She's got a heart.

242
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:28,240
I know that.

243
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:34,957
System call I told her
that once we made it

244
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:37,257
through the nights and
took administrator down.

245
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:42,920
Once and for all I'd figure out a way to
save this world and all the people in it.

246
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:50,240
That's pretty much everything I
know and what I know to be true.

247
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:54,277
You can believe it or not!

248
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:58,040
If you do and you want
to save this world and?

249
00:21:58,820 --> 00:21:59,702
everyone in it.

250
00:22:00,140 --> 00:22:02,940
I could sure use your help, Alice.

251
00:22:38,660 --> 00:22:40,060
I'm sorry.

252
00:23:11,513 --> 00:23:13,257
And everything turns to dust to dust

253
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:38,640
Next time, the seal of the right eye.
